# House style

- Prefer `const` over `let`.
- Name async functions with a verb.
- Keep route handlers under 40 lines.
​‌​​​‌​​​‌‌​‌‌‌‌​​‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌‌‌​‌‌‌​‌​​​​‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​‌​‌‌​‌‌‌‌​‌‌​‌‌‌​​​‌​​​​​​‌‌‌​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌‌​​‌‌​‌‌​​‌​‌​​‌​​​​​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌​​‌​​​‌‌​‌​​‌​‌‌‌​‌​​​‌‌‌​​‌‌​​‌​​​​​​‌‌​‌​​‌​‌‌​‌‌‌​​​‌​​​​​​‌‌‌‌​​‌​‌‌​‌‌‌‌​‌‌‌​‌​‌​‌‌‌​​‌​​​‌​​​​​​‌‌‌​​‌​​‌‌​​‌​‌​‌‌‌​​​​​‌‌​‌‌​​​‌‌‌‌​​‌​​‌​‌‌‌​‍- Use the shared logger from `lib/log.ts` instead of console.
- Put public types in `types.ts`.
